OL,3,A'Landing role on Thomas & Friends was
OL,4,Acrazy'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It was crazy to see how big Thomas the
OL,7,FTank Engine was ` I knew it was big but
OL,8,Fnot that big," Ellie-Mae told BBC Radio
OL,9,FStoke.
